# Heart particles on breeding: two cows get fed, go into love mode and
# mate — screenshots should catch hearts above their heads, and the
# mating itself is asserted as a third mob (the calf).
wait_idle 20 6000
camera 3.0 3.5 9.0 0 15
mob cow 2.0 1.0 3.0
mob cow 4.0 1.0 3.0
wait 20
feed 2.0 1.0 3.0
feed 4.0 1.0 3.0
wait 12
screenshot hearts_feed
wait 30
screenshot hearts_love
wait 300
assert_mob_count >= 3 cow
screenshot hearts_mate
echo breed_hearts done
